          "class": "DepictionHeaderView",
          "title": "Scrub the Now Playing bar",
          "useBoldText": true,
          "useBottomMargin": true
        },
        {
          "class": "DepictionMarkdownView",
          "markdown": "<p>Makes the <strong>CarPlay Now Playing</strong> progress bar draggable. There is <strong>no Settings pane</strong> — install it and reconnect CarPlay.</p><p>A white thumb appears on the bar. Drag and release to seek, even when an app (YouTube and others) disables native scrubbing.</p>",
          "useRawFormat": true
        },
